-Equipment needed:
	-Oscilloscope with NTP (SDS814X-E or SDS1104X-E)
	-Master clock source with NTP (Meinberg)
		 -Meinberg IPs
		-SFAT: 100.64.20.6
		-MFAT: 100.64.8.5
	-SUT (SFAT/MFAT) ethernet port/open interface port
	-Packet capture method (Wireshark)
	-Analog signal to measure (Datascout or signal from FATA/IDF)
	
What I need currently to measure analog-packet delay:
	-Connection to SUT (switch port interface open), preferably within the same Stratum as the network device that is being measured
	
Procedure:

Script Flow:
-Set user variables (scope ip, NTP server ip, submask, gateway)
-Set connection using pyvisa
-Configure NTP 
